[{"s":1795282340,"e":1795285946,"t":"Three Shades of Green","st":"S1 E01","d":"Ireland is known for its raw nature – pounding waves, cliffs, rain and storms.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQU352137A_1155246969_0_20250827T205536933Z_121_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-xsvxn.jpeg"},{"s":1795285946,"e":1795289563,"t":"Three Shades of Green","st":"S1 E02","d":"Ireland was a place to experiment with exotic plants. Lots of sun and rain have made it a botanical paradise.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQU352137A_1155236864_0_20250827T205537939Z_103_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-xsvxn.jpeg"},{"s":1795289563,"e":1795293181,"t":"Three Shades of Green","st":"S1 E03","d":"Ireland's Midland has its own distinctive charm – rivers, lakes, and gently rolling countryside.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQU352137A_1155237358_0_20250827T205530800Z_65_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-xsvxn.jpeg"},{"s":1795293181,"e":1795296769,"t":"Italy, My Love","st":"S1 E01","d":"Emilia-Romagna, Italy, is a gourmet paradise, home to iconic foods, wildlife, and sustainable Rimini.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQU352137A_1126234067_3_20250813T172041060Z_30_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-ztbvg.jpeg"},{"s":1795296769,"e":1795300411,"t":"Italy, My Love","st":"S1 E02","d":"The Marche - Italy's last undiscovered region. Young locals are fighting for their traditions.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQU352137A_1126234220_1_20250813T172038804Z_115_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-4h9xv.jpeg"},{"s":1795300411,"e":1795304022,"t":"Italy, My Love","st":"S1 E03","d":"Lazio: the splendour of the ‘Eternal City' plus lakes, mountains, gardens and the culinary delights.","i":"https://tvpnlo